      "description": "Seven keys, a joystick and room for your ideas. Chord Lab turns your iPhone and iPad into a chord instrument with 3D controls, expressive sounds and layers of accompaniment. Open it, choose a sound and start playing.\n\nMAKE THE CHORDS YOURS\nPlay full chords, strums, arpeggios or drones. Choose your key and octave, customize each button or build a voicing note by note. Save your shapes and assign different chord variations to the joystick's eight directions.\n\nEXPLORE 110 SOUNDS\nCombine original synthesizer sounds with a library of sample-based instruments. Discover pads, plucks, organs, synths and more. Shape each sound with glide, envelopes, filter cutoff and resonance.\n\nBUILD YOUR EFFECT CHAIN\nExplore 15 effects, including Cloud and Shimmer reverbs, delays, chorus, vibrato, phaser, tremolo, vinyl and drive. Connect up to six modules in series, adjust their parameters and save your chains. Effects process the chord keys while beats, sustained pads and textures stay independent.\n\nLO-FI, RHYTHMS AND ATMOSPHERES\nPlay along with 40 electronic rhythms, including lo-fi grooves and beats inspired by the 1980s. Add sustained pads in all 12 keys and textures made from real recordings: vinyl, rain, forest, coffee machine, city and night. Each layer has its own volume.\n\nCONNECT AND CAPTURE\nUse MIDI input and output, visual control mapping and compatible game controllers. Record your mix as a 24-bit stereo WAV, listen back and share your ideas. Save and import setups to recall your settings. Layers you start can keep playing in the background.\n\nAn AUv3 instrument extension brings the sounds and sound controls to compatible hosts. The seven-key interface, beats and backing pads belong to the standalone app.\n\nGIVE YOUR INSTRUMENT ITS OWN LOOK\nChoose hardware colors and animated backgrounds with a retro feel. Play in portrait or landscape on iPhone and iPad. The interface is available in English and Portuguese.\n\nOne purchase. No subscriptions or in-app purchases. Works offline, with no account required.\n\nSupport: contato@dedealbano.com\nPrivacy policy: https://dedealbano.com/politica-de-privacidade-chordlab/",
